<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id" />
  <para style="h">EFES</para>
  <para style="toc1">WAA EFES</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bataaxal bi Yàlla may Pool, <optbreak /> mu bind ko</para>
  <para style="mt1">WAA EFES</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Man Pool, ndawul Kirist Yeesu ci coobarey Yàlla, maa leen di bind, yéen gaayi Yàlla yu sell yi te gëm Kirist Yeesu ci dëkku Efes. <verse eid="EPH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Yal na leen Yàlla sunu Baay ak Boroom bi Yeesu Kirist may yiw ak jàmm.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Cant ñeel na Yàlla Baayu sunu Boroom Yeesu Kirist, mi nu sotti ci sunu bokk ci Kirist lépp luy barkeel ci baatin te nekk ca bérab yu kawe ya. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Ndaxte ba àddina sosoogul, tànn na nu ci Kirist, ngir nu mana teew fa kanamam, sell te ñàkk sikk. Ci kaw mbëggeelam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manees na ko tekki nii it: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ñàkk sikk ci biir mbëggeel. </char><char style="fr" closed="false">5 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Séddoo na…</char></note> <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />séddoo na nu lu jiitu, def nu ay doomam jaarale ko ci Yeesu Kirist, ndaxte looloo doon yéene ju rafet, ji mu tëral ci coobareem. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Na ndamam jolli ndax yiw wu réy, wi mu nu sotti ci Soppeem bi.<verse eid="EPH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Moom jot na nu ak deretam ji ñu tuur, maanaam baal nu sunuy bàkkaar, ci kaw yiw wu yaatu, <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />wi mu nu baawaanal. Yàlla sol na nu xel mu mat ak dégg, <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />ci feeñal nu mbóoti coobareem, dëppook yéeneem ju rafet, ji mu jaarale ci Kirist. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Mu tëral ne, bu jamono yi wéyee ba lépp mat, dina dajale lépp ci kilifteefu Kirist, muy ci kaw, muy ci suuf. <verse eid="EPH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Am nanu cér ci moom bu nu Yàlla sédd lu jiitu ci dogalam, moom miy doxal lépp ci ni mu ko àttee ci coobareem. <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Noonu nuy jollil ndamam, nun ñi jëkka wékk sunu yaakaar ci Kirist.<verse eid="EPH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Yéen itam, bi ngeen déggee kàddug dëgg gi, di xibaaru jàmm, bi leen tegtal yoonu mucc, te ngeen gëm ko, Yàlla tàmpe na leen ni ñoñam ak Xel mu Sell, mi mu dige woon. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Te Xel mi mooy dawal gi nu Yàlla jox ci cér, bi mu nu dencal, ba kera muy goreel ñi mu jotal boppam, te ñépp jollil ndamam.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool sant na Yàlla, di ñaanal ñi gëm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Bi ma déggee nag seen ngëm ci Boroom bi Yeesu ak seen mbëggeel ci gaayi Yàlla yu sell yépp, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />duma noppee sant Yàlla, di leen boole ci samay ñaan. <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />Li may ñaan Yàllay sunu Boroom Yeesu Kirist, di Baay bi yelloo ndam, mooy lii: mu sol leen xel mu xóot, te xamal leen boppam <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />ci leeral seeni xol. Noonu dingeen xam yaakaaru ëllëg, ji leen Yàlla wooye, di ndam lu xel manta daj, li nekk ci cér, bi mu dencal gaayam yu sell yi. <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />Ngeen xam it, ni kàttanam màgge ba jéggi dayo, jëm ci nun ñi gëm, dëppook dooleem ju ràññiku, <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />ji mu jëfe ci Kirist, ci li mu ko dekkal, dëël ko ci ndijooram ca bérab yu kawe ya, <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />mu tiim lu sore malaaka yépp, muy kilifa, boroom sañ-sañ, boroom doole mbaa buur, te gëna màgg wépp tur wu ñu mana tudd, muy tey, muy ëllëg. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Yàlla suufeel na lépp fi kanamam, def ko kilifag lépp ci mbooloom ñi gëm, <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />miy jëmmam, di matug Kirist, mi fees mbindeef mu ne ci fànn gu ne.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">Ku gëm Kirist dina nekk nit ku bees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Yéen itam Yàlla dekkal na leen, yéen ñi doon ndee fa kanamam ci seeni moy ak seeni bàkkaar. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Ci biir yooyu ngeen doon dund démb, topp doxalinu àddina, tey déggal kilifag boroom sañ-sañ yi ci jaww ji, di xel mu bon miy jëf ci kureelu ñi déggadil Yàlla. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Nun it booba àndoon nanu ak ñoom ca seen dund ga, di topp sunu bakkan ciy wut bànneexi yaram ak coobarey xel. Noonu ci sunu bindu nit yeyoo nanu meru Yàlla, ni ña ca des. <verse eid="EPH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Waaye Yàlla mi bare yërmande, ci kaw mbëggeel gu réy, gi mu am ci nun, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />dundalaat na nu ak Kirist, fekk ndee lanu woon fa kanamam ci sunuy bàkkaar-- ci kaw yiwu Yàlla ngeen mucce. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Te dekkal na nu ak Kirist Yeesu, dëël nu ak moom ca bérab yu kawe ya. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Noonu ba fu jamono yem, dina lañal fi sunu kanam yiwam wu réy wi xel manta takk, jaar ci baaxaay gi mu nu won ci Kirist Yeesu. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Ndaxte ci yiwu Yàlla ngeen mucce ci kaw ngëm, te loolu jógewul ci yéen, mayu Yàlla la; <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />du peyu jëf, ba kenn di ci kañu. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Ndaxte jëfu Yàlla lanu; moo nu bind ci Kirist Yeesu, ngir nu wéy ci jëf yu rafet, yi mu nu fàgguloon ca njàlbéen ga.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ñi gëm Kirist, benn lañu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Kon nag yéen ñi dul Yawut cib juddu, yéen ñi xaraful, te ñi xaraf ci seen yaram ci loxol nit ñoo leen teg ay yéefar, fàttalikuleen lii: <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />booba amuleen woon benn cér ci Kirist, mbaa benn baat ci kureelu bànni Israyil. Bokkuleen woon ci kóllëre, gi Yàlla fas ak ñoom, te ëmb dige ya. Amuleen woon benn yaakaar mbaa benn xam-xamu Yàlla ci àddina. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Waaye léegi ci seen bokk ci Kirist Yeesu, yéen ñi sore woon jege ngeen ndax deretu Kirist ji ñu tuur.<verse eid="EPH 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Ndaxte mooy sunu jàmm, moom mi jël Yawut ak ki dul Yawut, def nu benn. Ñag bi doxoon sunu diggante te sosoon sunu dëngoo, moo ko màbb ci li mu joxe yaramam, <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />far noonu yoonu Musaa, muy ndigal ya ak dogal ya. Noonu la nu jële, Yawut ak ki dul Yawut, def nu benn ci moom, ba nu jàmmoo. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Nun ñaar, ñi def benn jëmm, jubale na nu ak Yàlla ci dee, gi mu dee ca bant ba ñu ko daajoon, dindee noonu sunu tongoonte. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Bi mu ko defee mu ñëw, yégalsi nu xibaaru jàmm fa kanam Yàlla, yéen ñi sore woon ak nun ñi jege. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Ndaxte nun ñaar ñépp am nanu bunt ci Yàlla Baay bi, jaar ci Kirist, ci ndimbalu menn Xel mu Sell mi.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Noonu dootuleen ay doxandéem mbaa ay gan, waaye am ngeen baat ci kureelu gaayi Yàlla yu sell yi, te waa këram ngeen. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Yéena ngi sukkandikoo ci fondamaa, bi ndawi Kirist yi ak yonent yi tabax, te Kirist Yeesu ci boppam di doju dalil wa. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Ci moom la doj yépp ràbbloo, ba tabax bi jóg, di màggalukaay bu sell ngir Boroom bi. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Ci seen bokk ci Kirist, Yàlla boole na leen tabax yéen itam, ba ngeen nekk dëkkukaayam, jaar ci Xel mu Sell mi.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">Sasu Pool ci xamle xibaaru Kirist ci xeet yi dul Yawut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Kon nag maa ngi leen di ñaanal, man Pool mi ñu tëj kaso ci turu Kirist ndax sas wi may bey ci yéen, xeet yi dul Yawut. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Wóor na ma ne dégg ngeen yenub xamle yiwu Yàlla, bi mu ma jagleel jëm ci yéen. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Yàlla feeñu na ma, xamal ma mbóoti mbir mi mu tëral, ni ma leen ko binde ci kàddu yu néew. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Bu ngeen jàngee loolu, dingeen mana xam bu wér dégg, gi ma am ci mbóoti mbiri Kirist. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Ci jamono yu weesu, loolu kumpa la woon ci doom Aadama, waaye léegi Yàlla feeñalal na ko ay ndawam ak yonentam yu sell yi, jaarale ko ci Xel mu Sell mi. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Mbir mi nii la tëdde: léegi xeet yi dul Yawut dañoo bokksi cér ak Yawut yi, bokk ak ñoom jenn jëmm, bokk wàll ci xéewal yi Yàlla dige ci Kirist Yeesu, te xibaaru jàmm bi xamle ko.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Xamle xibaaru jàmm boobu nag, Yàlla fal na ma ci jawriñ ci kaw yiwam, te di ma dooleel ci kàttanam. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />May na ma, man mi gëna tuuti ci gaayi Yàlla yu sell yi, may xibaar xeeti àddina barkeel yu xel dajul yi ci Kirist; <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />te it may sulli melokaanu mbir mu xóot, mi Yàlla tëral te doon kumpa njàlbéen ga ba tey ci moom mi sos lépp. <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />Waaye léegi nee na fàŋŋ, ngir kilifa yi ak boroom sañ-sañ yi ca bérab yu kawe ya mana xam ni Xelum Yàlla xóote, jaar ci li ñu gis ci mbooloom ñi gëm Kirist. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Mooy dogal bi sax dàkk, te Yàlla tëral ko ci Kirist Yeesu sunu Boroom. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Ci turam am nanu kóolute fa kanam Yàlla, ak bunt bu yaatu ci moom ci kaw ngëm. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Maa ngi leen di ñaan nag, ngeen baña yoqi ndax coono, yi may jële ci bey sama sas ci yéen, xam ne coono yooyu ñoo leen di jural ndam.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool ñaanal na ñi gëm, ñu sax ci Kirist</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Moo tax maa ngi sukk, jublu ci Yàlla Baay <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />biy cosaanul njaboot gépp, muy ci kaw, muy ci suuf. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Ma di ko ñaan, mu may leen, ci kaw ndamam lu amul kem, Xel mu Sell mi feddali seen baatin ak kàttan gu mag, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />ba Kirist dëkk ci seeni xol ci kaw ngëm. Te ngeen sax noonu te sampu ci mbëggeelu Yàlla, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />ba jagoo, yéen ak gaayi Yàlla yu sell yépp, guddaay ba, yaatuwaay ba, kawe ga ak xóotaay ba, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />te xam mbëggeelu Kirist, gi raw mépp xel. Noonu dingeen fees dell ak matug Yàlla.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Léegi nag, na ndam li féete ak Yàlla, mi mana yeggale lépp luy ñaan mbaa yéene, ba weesu ko fuuf, dëppook kàttan giy jëf ci nun; <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />moo yelloo ndamul mbooloom ñi gëm jamonoy jamono ba fàww, jaar ci Kirist Yeesu. Amiin.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">Mbooloom ñi gëm, jenn jëmm la, ni céri yaram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Man mi ñu tëj kaso ngir Boroom bi nag, maa ngi leen di dénk, ngeen dund dundin wu yellook wooteb Yàlla. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Ngeen woyof toyy te lewet, di muñalante tey baalante ci mbëggeel, <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />te dem ba fu seen kàttan yem, ngeen likkoo ci jàmm, bay sàmm booloo gi leen Xelum Yàlla may.<verse eid="EPH 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Jenn jëmm moo am, menn Xel, ak jenn yaakaaru ëllëg ju wooteb Yàlla ëmb. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Benn Boroom it a am, genn ngëm, ak benn seedeb ngëm ci li ñu leen sóob ci ndox. <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Te jenn Yàllaa am, di Baayu ñépp, mu tiim ñépp, fees ñépp te dëkk ci ñépp.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Waaye ku nekk ci nun ak mayam, ni nu ko Kirist séddalee. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Looloo tax Mbind mi ne:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">«Yéeg na ba ca fa gëna kawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">yóbbaale mbooloom noon mu bare, mi mu not,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">tey séddale nit ñi ay may.»<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Su nu waxee ne «yéeg na,» li moo ci génn: daa jëkka wàcc ba ca bérab ya gëna suufe. <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Ki wàccoon moo yéegaat, ba tiim asamaan yépp, ngir fees lépp. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Moo may ñii di ay ndawam, ñii ay yonent, ñii ay taskati xibaaru jàmm bi, ak ñeneen ñuy sàmm mbooloom ñi gëm te di ko jàngal. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Maye na leen, ngir ñu waajal gaayi Yàlla yu sell yi, ñu mana bey seen sas ci taxawal mbooloom Kirist, di jëmmam. <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />Noonu nu mànkoo ci sunu ngëm ak ci xam Doomu Yàlla ji, ba kera nuy egg ci nekk nit ku sotti te taxaw taxawaay bu dëppook matug Kirist.<verse eid="EPH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Noonu dootunu ay gone yu njànglem nit ku ñëw di fàbbi ci seeni làqarci ak seeni pexe, nu mel ni ay gaal yu duus yi ak ngelaw li di baaje. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Waaye dinanu wax dëgg, ëmb ko ci mbëggeel, bay màgg ci fànn gu ne ci sunu bokk ci Kirist. Mooy bopp, <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />te jëmm jépp ci moom lay dunde, di jëmm ju ràbboo te déggoo ci bépp tenqo, te cér bu nekk di def warugaram. Noonu jëmm ji di yokku ak a màgg ci biir mbëggeel.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sunu jikko ju jëkk ak sunu jikkoy tey</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Maa ngi leen di wax lii nag, te di ko dëggal ci kanam Boroom bi: buleen dundeeti ni xeeti àddina yi, ci seeni xalaati neen <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />ak seen xel mu lëndëm. Dañoo génn ci dundu Yàlla, ndax umple gi ñu am ci moom, ak li ñu ko tëjal seen xol. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Seen xol dafa dërkiis, ba ñu bayliku ciy topp seen nafsu, di sóobu ci bépp sobe te xér ci.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Waaye du dundin woowu ngeen jàng ci Kirist. <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Ndax yaakaar naa ne dégg ngeen Kirist te jàng ngeen ci moom, ba xam dëgg gi Yeesu ëmb. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Maanaam ngeen yulli seen jikkoy judduwaale ju bon ji daan fés ci seeni jëf, di gëna yées, te ànd ak i bëgg-bëggam yu di naxi kese. <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />Te ngeen yeeslu ci seen biir xel, <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />te soloo jikko ju bees, ji Yàlla sàkk ci njubte lu dëggu ak sellaay gu dëggu.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Melow dund gu bees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Kon nag bàyyileen di fen, tey wax dëgg kenn ku nekk ci moroomam, ndax ku nekk sa genn-wàllu moroom nga. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Ku mer, bu mu jàll aw kaañ; bu jant bi sowaale seen mer, <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />ba ngeen may Seytaane bunt. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Ku daan sàcc, na ko dëddu te jublu ci liggéey lu baax ci ay loxoom, ngir mu mana dimbali ñi néew doole.<verse eid="EPH 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Bu genn kàddu gu ñaaw génn ci seen gémmiñ, waaye su wax yegsee, nangeen wax lu rafet, ba faj soxlay seeni moroom, te teg ñi leen di déglu ci yoonu yiw. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Buleen yóbbe tiis Xelu Yàlla mu Sell, mi leen tàmpe ngir bésu goreel ba. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Dëdduleen lépp luy wex mbaa tàng bopp, luy mer mbaa coow, lépp luy xaste mbaa coxor. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Te ngeen baax ci seen diggante, di laayante biir tey baalante, ni leen Yàlla baale ci turu Kirist.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Yéen nag ñiy goney Yàlla, yi mu bëgg ci xolam, royleen ko ci loolu. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Ngeen wéer seen dund ci mbëggeel, mel ni Kirist mi nu bëgg, ba joxe bakkanam ngir nun, di sarax su ñu jébbal Yàlla te neex ko ni xetu latkoloñ.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Waaye naka njaaloo ak bépp sobe mbaa bëgge, jéllale naa jëf ji sax, waaye bu ko làmmiñ tudd, ni mu jekke ci gaayi Yàlla yu sell yi. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Dawleen it lu jekkadee, ni wax ju ñaaw mbaa waxi caaxaan ak kaf yu bon, te ngeen sax ci sant Yàlla. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Na leen wóor ne kenn ku jikkowoo ndoxaan, sobe mbaa bëgge, maanaam bokkaale Yàlla, kooku du am cér ci nguuru Kirist ak Yàlla. <verse eid="EPH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Bu leen kenn nax ci ay waxi neen, ndaxte jëf yooyooy tax meru Yàlla di wàcc ci kureelu ñi ko déggadil. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Kon nag buleen séq ak ñoom dara. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Lëndëm ngeen woon, waaye léegi leer ngeen ndax seen bokk ci Boroom bi.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="EPH 5:8">Dundeleen ni ay goney leer</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 5:8">Dundeleen nag ni ay goney leer. <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />Leer, mbaax lay meññ, njub ak dëgg. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Dëggal-leen ci seeni jëf li neex Boroom bi, <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />te daw lépp luy jëfi lëndëm yu amul njariñ, bay weer sax ku koy def. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Ndaxte waxtaane sax li ñuy def ci nëbbu, lu ruslu la; <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />waaye leer, lu mu ëmb, fésal ko. <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />Ndaxte lu jaxasoo ak leer di leer. Looloo tax ñu ne:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">«Yewwul, yaw mi nelaw,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">te jóge ci biir néew yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">kon Kirist dina ne ràññ ci yaw, <optbreak /> ni leeru jant buy fenk.»<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Noonu sàmmleen seen dundin, waxuma ni ñu amul xel, waaye ni ñu am xel, <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />tey jariñoo jot gi, ndaxte nu ngi ci jamono ju bon. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Buleen ñàkk bopp nag, waaye xamleen liy coobarey Boroom bi. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Buleen màndi it ci sàngara, liy ndeyi ñaawteef, waaye feesleen ak Xel mu Sell mi; <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />di waxante ci seen biir ci ay taalifi Sabóor, ciy woy ak i cant yu tukkee ci Xelum Yàlla, di woy ak a kañ Boroom bi ci seen xol. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Gërëmleen Yàlla Baay bi ci turu Yeesu Kirist Boroom bi, fu ngeen mana tollu, ci lu mu mana doon; <verse eid="EPH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />teg ca nangul sa moroom ci biir wegeelu Kirist.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Diggante góor ak soxnaam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Naka yéen jigéen ñi, nangeen nangul seeni jëkkër, ni su doon Boroom bi. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Ndaxte góor mooy kilifag soxnaam, ni Kirist nekke kilifag mbooloom ñi gëm, muy jëmmam ji muy sàmm. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Ni mbooloo mi nag jiitale Kirist, noonu la jigéen ji wara jiitale jëkkëram ci lépp.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Yéen nag góor ñi, na ku nekk bëgg soxnaam, ni Kirist bëgge mbooloo mi, ba joxe bakkanam ndax moom, <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />ngir sellal ko ak kàddoom, ba mu laab ni ku sangu set. <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />Noonu dina ko jël, mu mel ni séet bu ñu waajal, di mbooloom mu soloo ndam, te gàkkul, rasul, taqul leneen, waaye mu sell te amul sikk.<verse eid="EPH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Na góor bëgg soxnaam, ni mu bëgge boppam. Bëgg sa soxna, bëgg sa bopp la. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Ndaxte kenn masula bañ sa yaram. Waaye danga koy dundal, di ko fonk. Noonu it la Kirist fonke mbooloo mi; <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />ndaxte noo di céri jëmmam. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />Mbind mi nee na: «Looloo tax góor di teqalikook ndeyam ak baayam, ànd ak soxnaam, ñoom ñaar doon kenn.» <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Loolu ëmb na mbóot mu xóot; man maa ngi wax ci lu jëm ci Kirist ak mbooloo mi. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Waaye li teew, na góor gu nekk bëgg soxnaam, ni mu bëgge boppam, te jigéen ji weg jëkkëram.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">Diggante waajur yi ak seen njaboot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Naka yéen xale yi, nangeen déggal seeni waajur, ci li ngeen bokk ci Boroom bi, ndaxte looloo rafet. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />«Teralal sa ndey ak sa baay,» mooy ndigal li jëkka ëmb dige, <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />maanaa: «ngir nga am gudd fan gu ànd ak jàmm.»<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Yéen baay yi it, buleen bundxataal xale yi, waaye ngeen yar leen, di leen yemale ak a yee ci Boroom bi.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Diggante jaam ak sangam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Yéen jaam yi, nangeen déggal seeni sang yu àddina, boole ci ragal ak wegeel, di ko def ak xol bu laab, ni su doon ngir Kirist. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Buleen ko def rekk ci ngistal, ngir sàkku ngërëmu nit, waaye ni ay jaami Kirist, di jëfe coobarey Yàlla ak seen xol bépp. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Beyleen seen sas nag ak xol bu tàlli, ni su doon ngir Boroom bi te du nit, <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />xam ne ku def lu baax, Boroom bi delloo la ko, muy jaam, muy gor.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Yéen it sang yi, jëfeleen noonu seen diggante ak seeni jaam, te dëddu gépp raglu, xam ne yéena bokk benn Boroom ci asamaan, te ñépp a yem fi moom.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Xeex ak Seytaane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Léegi nag doolewuleen ci Boroom bi te soloo kàttanam gu mag gi. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Gànnaayooleen yérey xarey Yàlla yépp, ngir mana jànkoonte ak pexey Seytaane. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Ndaxte ndëndu xare jib na, waxuma sunu diggante ak nit ñi, waaye ak kilifa yiy nëxal àddina si, ñuy kilifa yi ak ay boroom sañ-sañ, di gaayi Seytaane yi ci bérab yu kawe yi. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Kon nag gànnaayooleen yérey xarey Yàlla yépp, ba mana jànkoonte jamono ju xeex bi taree, not lépp te taxaw temm.<verse eid="EPH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Taxawleen kon temm, geñoo dëgg te sàngoo njub, muy seen kiiraayu dënn. <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />Solooleen jàmm, ji xibaaru jàmm biy joxe, ni ay dàll ci seeni tànk, ba jekk ci lépp. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Defleen it ngëm, muy seen pakk, ba mana fél jum yi leen Seytaane di fitt. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Defleen mucc, muy seen mbaxanam xare, ak kàddug Yàlla, muy jaasi ji leen Xel mu Sell mi tëggal. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Deeleen ñaan ci xeeti ñaan yépp ci kàttanu Xel mu Sell mi, te sax ci ak farlu gu mat sëkk, di ñaanal gaayi Yàlla yu sell yi yépp.<verse eid="EPH 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Te buleen ma ci fàtte, ngir waxtu wu ma ubbee sama gémmiñ, ma am lu ma wax, ba mana xamle ak fit wu dëgër mbóoti xibaaru jàmm bi. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Ndaw laa ci, lu ñu jéng; yal na ma Yàlla may fit wu ma waxe, ni mu ma ware.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tàggoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Yónnee naa leen Tisig sama mbokk, mi ma sopp, te muy jawriñ ju takku ci liggéeyu Boroom bi, ngir mu xamal leen lépp li aju ci man ak li may def. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Maa leen ko yónneel sama bopp, ngir ngeen xam li nu nekke, te mu dëfal seeni xol.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Yéen bokk yi, yal na leen Yàlla Baay bi ak Yeesu Kirist Boroom bi may jàmm ak mbëggeel gu ànd ak ngëm. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Yal na yiwu Yàlla ànd ak ñépp, ñi bëgg Boroom bi Yeesu Kirist ak mbëggeel gu sax.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>